# Dependencies (Dart / Flutter)

## Pinning
- Keep `pubspec.yaml` constraints explicit enough for reproducible builds; commit `pubspec.lock` for apps (this project is an app).

## Updates
- Prefer periodic `dart pub outdated` (or `flutter pub outdated`) over random major bumps.
- Before upgrading a **major** version, read the changelog and run `flutter analyze` and `flutter test`.

## Adding packages
- Prefer packages that are actively maintained and widely used; check pub.dev scores and last publish date.
- Remove unused dependencies to shrink the attack surface and build time.

## Native / codegen
- After changing dependencies that affect Android/iOS/macOS, run the app on at least one target or CI to catch native build breaks.
